00:22:01.962 --> 00:22:04.753
It drives me crazy

00:22:04.753 --> 00:22:06.936
when they just go on and on and on and on.

00:22:06.936 --> 00:22:09.353
Because, see I pay attention,

00:22:10.810 --> 00:22:13.611
And if you're not going
anywhere with this,

00:22:13.611 --> 00:22:16.384
it drives me crazy.

00:22:16.384 --> 00:22:20.134
One of the strengths of
preaching is outline.

00:22:21.693 --> 00:22:24.944
Because an outline gives the
listener something to follow,

00:22:24.944 --> 00:22:26.800
that has structure.

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:28.886
When you're all over the
place everything you're saying

00:22:28.886 --> 00:22:31.863
