your message has no focus,

00:22:31.863 --> 00:22:34.300
it becomes hard to follow.

00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:38.704
It's hard to follow somebody
who doesn't have focus.

00:22:38.704 --> 00:22:39.900
Where are we going with this?

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:40.733
What is the point?

00:22:40.733 --> 00:22:42.120
