00:22:42.120 --> 00:22:44.193
Get to the point, what is this about?

00:22:44.193 --> 00:22:45.843
And for a while you'll listen

00:22:45.843 --> 00:22:48.494
because you're trying to
see if it has structure.

00:22:48.494 --> 00:22:50.619
And when you figure out
that they're just talking,

00:22:50.619 --> 00:22:53.702
